        "created_at": "2025-10-11T02:23:01.814Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I figured this episode was going to be a total snooze for me, since I don’t know ANYBODY in the voice-acting world, beyond really famous people like Keith David.  But then I figured out an angle that would work for me to push, and I’m gonna make a project of it over coming weeks as I get time.  I don’t know any modern VAs, so instead I’ll use <em>classic</em> VAs from the Golden Age of Radio, which I’m extremely familiar with.  Since most people won’t know these mostly long dead individuals, I’ll include a YouTube clip with each one so you can hear them saying something that I can directly imagine them saying in-character.  Obviously, it’ll take some time to collect almost 100 samples, so watch this space.</p>\n<p>To start us off, here’s Peggy Webber as Nightmist:</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kghrevdWGg8t%3D1006&amp;feature=youtu.be\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/c3fa9c27e75a6615700f3e42a183ae2c3bbc71c7.png\" class=\"site-icon\" data-dominant-color=\"FF103A\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kghrevdWGg8t%3D1006&amp;feature=youtu.be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">YouTube</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:480/360;\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b3c94ef4bf73e5a9f3299187b2888b45c990f463.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" data-dominant-color=\"2D291D\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kghrevdWGg8t%3D1006&amp;feature=youtu.be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Escape - Confession</a></h3>\n\n  <p>12/31/47, episode 21This episode provided by the Old Time Radio Researchers Group At Yahoo-Video Upload powered by https://www.TunesToTube.com</p>\n\n\n  </article>